{"agent":"Monster3-fix-B6fae86acc5-7267fe","data":{"budget":"","claim":"The live code exposes four lane-process knobs (lanes.event_buffer, lanes.pass_env, lanes.scope, lanes.stop_grace_s) that the upgrade manifest replay() does not declare.","falsifier":"replay() already containing lanes.event_buffer (the parity test passing) refutes the claim.","item":"fix-B6fae86acc5","mechanism":"UM.replay() rebuilds declared knobs from templates/upgrade/changes.toml plus unreleased/*.toml fragments; surface() reads the live registry. The four knobs shipped in the lane contract and process-headless driver commits but were never declared as fragments, so replay() falls behind the live code.","probe":"python -m pytest tests/compat/test_surface.py::test_the_current_code_has_exactly_the_knobs_and_event_kinds_the_manifest_gives_it -q","probe_output":"FAILED AssertionError: Left contains 4 more items: {lanes.event_buffer:1000, lanes.pass_env:[...], lanes.scope:none, lanes.stop_grace_s:10}","question":"Why is test_the_current_code_has_exactly_the_knobs_and_event_kinds_the_manifest_gives_it red on main?","sources":[],"verdict":"CONFIRMED"},"id":"e32207ffb804d6ebb4d24b4b0","kind":"research.recorded","lamport":118123,"schema":1,"subject":"Rf80c488bfd","ts":"2026-10-31T10:13:27.507564Z"}
