{"agent":"Monster3-fix-B6fae86acc5-7267fe","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"The manifest files declare all four lane knob values as TOML strings: `new = \"1000\"` for `lanes.event_buffer`, `new = '[\"PATH\", ...]'` for `lanes.pass_env`, `new = '\"none\"'` for `lanes.scope`, and `new = \"10\"` for `lanes.stop_grace_s`. TOML parsing therefore exposes `\"1000\"`, `\"10\"`, and the literal string contents (including embedded quote characters) as Python `str` values, not as `1000`, `10`, `\"none\"`, or a list. Running the added regression test fails at the first new assertion: `assert knobs[\"lanes.event_buffer\"] == 1000` gets `'1000' != 1000`. Either the TOML values must be written as real typed TOML values (`1000`, `[\"PATH\", ...]`, `\"none\"`, `10`) or the test must assert the string forms actually stored.","digest":"56c79e9f857e3e86","location":"tests/test_lanes_manifest_parity.py:17-20 and the four `knob_added.lanes.*.toml` files","severity":"HIGH","title":"tests/test_lanes_manifest_parity.py:17-20 and the four `knob_added.lanes.*.toml` files"}],"chunks_total":1,"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":4635,"diff_sha":"b6b13da2c08e11d121a227c30e4dcb21921221510ab4171fddf0d4b775180743","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":291.5,"family":"deepseek","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","output_digest":"e81d3d62a2d9f473","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B6fae86acc5.rubber_duck.lan-deepseek-v4-pro.20261031T101553Z-b1bde9c5.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_for_holder":"[REDACTED:hostname]-fix-B6fae86acc5-7267fe reviewed [REDACTED:hostname]-ddflow-7267fe's fix-B6fae86acc5","reviewed_head":"82b159f7dee6ce7fd14f80f5a676fb1d8af07ba6","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/templates/upgr